  "instructions": [
    "In a large bamboo tray, heat the sesame oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and saute for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the cubed tofu and cook until golden brown.",
    "Add the snow peas, soy sauce, and korean chili flakes, and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the chicken broth and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let the stew simmer for 15 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped green onions.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
